1
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,000
MIDNIGHT

2
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:10,000
[yawns]

3
00:00:47,000 --> 00:00:49,000
[opening theme music playing]

4
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:54,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

5
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

6
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:35,000
[narrator] Upon entering the palace,
Killua's first thought was…

7
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,000
who wasn't supposed to be
on the first floor,

8
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:49,000
standing right in front of them.

9
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:06,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] Who are these guys?
Where did they come from?

10
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:11,000
[narrator] Youpi was faced with
an implausible situation of his own,

11
00:03:11,000 --> 00:03:15,000
but he simply ceased
all thought processes.

12
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:39,000
[flesh crackling]

13
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,000
My body is a shield.

14
00:03:47,000 --> 00:03:50,000
As long as I stand, the King will be safe.

15
00:03:56,000 --> 00:03:58,000
Perhaps because of this,

16
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:02,000
he cared less about his individual
identity than the other two.

17
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:04,000
This lack of ego became strength.

18
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:12,000
[narrator] Youpi smiled belligerently

19
00:04:12,000 --> 00:04:17,000
and began transforming
as Shoot stood frozen in his tracks.

20
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:27,000
[narrator] It wasn't because Shoot
found himself psychologically defeated.

21
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:28,000
He knew…

22
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:33,000
[Shoot] If I move
any closer to him than this, he'll strike.

23
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:52,000
it came.

24
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:54,000
Huh?

25
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,000
[rumbling]

26
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:10,000
[Killua gasps]
Wait. This is the Dragon Dive!

27
00:05:12,000 --> 00:05:14,000
So Netero's friend was…

28
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,000
[narrator] Only Killua understood
what was happening,

29
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:19,000
and it froze him on the spot.

30
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:05,000
[Killua] Seriously?
How in the hell did he realize that?

31
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:08,000
And so quickly in a situation like this?

32
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:27,000
Or, as Nen is known
to intensify after death,

33
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:31,000
would their bodies simply rot and decay
without ever being found?

34
00:06:32,000 --> 00:06:33,000
No one knew the answer.

35
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:44,000
That meant that
in the worst-case scenario,

36
00:06:53,000 --> 00:06:54,000
Gon!

37
00:06:55,000 --> 00:06:57,000
[Morel] It's not Shoot's fault.

38
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:01,000
Even I didn't realize it
as quickly as Killua did.

39
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:19,000
[narrator] However, at that moment,

40
00:07:19,000 --> 00:07:23,000
Shoot was experiencing
a completely different emotion.

41
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:30,000
[Shoot] Gon!
I want to scream it to the entire world!

42
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,000
That's Gon!

43
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:37,000
He's so much younger than me,

44
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:53,000
muffling even my own words
so that no one could hurt me.

45
00:07:55,000 --> 00:08:00,000
I despised myself, but I couldn't fix it.

46
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:05,000
Friends and teachers gave me advice,
but I brushed it off

47
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:08,000
'cause they didn't have
those fears themselves.

48
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:10,000
They were strong.

49
00:08:10,000 --> 00:08:12,000
But somehow…

50
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:28,000
[narrator] All of this was true.

51
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:31,000
Shoot did indeed shy away from everything.

52
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:40,000
[narrator] What Shoot failed to realize

53
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:43,000
was that
whenever he'd been faced with adversity,

54
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:46,000
that's when he truly came into his own.

55
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:01,000
[growls]

56
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,000
Hmm?

57
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:17,000
[groans]

58
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:19,000
-[Hunters gasping]
-[Gon grunts]

59
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:21,000
[Morel and Shoot] Knuckle and Meleoron…

60
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,000
[Gon and Killua] Are alive!

61
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,000
[Menthuthuyoupi] What?

62
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:56,000
Who the hell just attacked me?

63
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:19,000
[narrator] Of course
they verified beforehand

64
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:24,000
that Hakoware, Bankruptcy Chapter 7
would work with God's Accomplice.

65
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:32,000
As long as God's Accomplice was in play,
Youpi would be unable to see A.P.R.,

66
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:47,000
which means my focus right now should be…

67
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:03,000
[narrator] So far,
everything had proceeded according to plan

68
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:06,000
but even though
Knuckle succeeded in landing a blow,

69
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:09,000
he felt a chill run down his spine.

70
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:10,000
[Knuckle gasps]

71
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,000
Is this for real?

72
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,000
His aura is unlimited!

73
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:28,000
[narrator] A veteran
of over 5,000 battles,

74
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:30,000
Knuckle could quantify
his opponent's power

75
00:11:30,000 --> 00:11:33,000
based on his experience and instinct.

76
00:11:34,000 --> 00:11:37,000
And encountering a foe
with unprecedented powers

77
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:45,000
But there was no comparing the monster

78
00:11:45,000 --> 00:11:48,000
that stood before him
with immense amounts of aura

79
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:51,000
to that of the countless opponents
he had faced before.

80
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:00,000
[Knuckle grunts]

81
00:12:01,000 --> 00:12:02,000
Five times that of Morel?

82
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:05,000
Ten times? More?

83
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,000
[groans] I can't tell.

84
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:25,000
All right,
let's say he's ten times stronger,

85
00:12:25,000 --> 00:12:27,000
with 700,000 aura.

86
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:30,000
Sure, he'd go bankrupt eventually.

87
00:12:30,000 --> 00:12:32,000
But how long would that take?

88
00:12:42,000 --> 00:12:43,000
[Neferpitou] Sire!

89
00:12:47,000 --> 00:12:48,000
[narrator] Just then…

90
00:13:03,000 --> 00:13:05,000
[Shaiapouf] Sire!

91
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:19,000
Sire!

92
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:20,000
[gasps]

93
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:43,000
[narrator] Since Pitou lacked wings,
the only option was to drop straight down.

94
00:13:43,000 --> 00:13:48,000
However, in this instance,
that may actually have been fortunate.

95
00:13:50,000 --> 00:13:53,000
Pitou would certainly have rushed
straight toward the King,

96
00:13:53,000 --> 00:13:54,000
just as Pouf did.

97
00:14:01,000 --> 00:14:04,000
would have had the presence of mind
to use En.

98
00:14:06,000 --> 00:14:07,000
As a result…

99
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:20,000
[Neferpitou] The guest's quarters
are on the second floor of the west tower.

100
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:25,000
There. The King is with the blind woman.

101
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:27,000
[gasps]

102
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,000
[shudders]

103
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:44,000
They're also using En to locate the King!

104
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:47,000
[narrator] And it was then,
in that very moment,

105
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:51,000
that Pitou realized
the true gravity of their situation.

106
00:14:53,000 --> 00:14:55,000
In an instant, Pitou crouched,

107
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:58,000
just as the four-legged ancestors
had done,

108
00:14:58,000 --> 00:15:00,000
upper legs hard as steel

109
00:15:00,000 --> 00:15:04,000
and swelled to twice the size
they had been during the battle with Kite.

110
00:15:23,000 --> 00:15:28,000
All in order to reach the King
before the intruders could.

111
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:33,000
But only a second later…

112
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:34,000
[gasps]

113
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:44,000
[narrator] The destination
Pitou was traveling toward

114
00:15:44,000 --> 00:15:47,000
began to emanate negative energy.

115
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:52,000
It was so strong that Pitou
immediately regretted this decision.

116
00:15:54,000 --> 00:15:57,000
[Neferpitou] This is the King's.

117
00:15:59,000 --> 00:16:02,000
[narrator] The aura coming from the King
was so unguarded

118
00:16:11,000 --> 00:16:15,000
unimaginably and dramatically
in the wrong direction.

119
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:19,000
But all besides the King
were still frozen in time.

120
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:33,000
breath catching in their throats
at the sight before them,

121
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:36,000
a young girl covered in blood.

122
00:18:37,000 --> 00:18:40,000
She rested in the arms
of a grotesque creature,

123
00:18:40,000 --> 00:18:42,000
who, despite his appearance,

124
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:18,000
This only increased Pitou's uneasiness.

125
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:23,000
You will heal Komugi.

126
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:54,000
[narrator] Through all of this,

127
00:19:54,000 --> 00:19:57,000
the two veterans
continued to stand in silence,

128
00:19:57,000 --> 00:20:01,000
watching their enemies closely
as an expression of respect.

129
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:13,000
What was unfolding
was an act of love for another's life.

130
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:33,000
You know this isn't
what you told me I was signing up for.

131
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:47,000
[King] Not here.

132
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:52,000
We should do this somewhere else.

133
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:55,000
I believe a change of venue…

134
00:21:05,000 --> 00:21:08,000
in order to separate the King
from the Royal Guards.

135
00:21:08,000 --> 00:21:12,000
He had no reason
to object to the King's proposal.

136
00:21:43,000 --> 00:21:45,000
it distracted the two men
for a split second,

137
00:21:46,000 --> 00:21:49,000
a distraction for which
one could not blame them.

138
00:22:05,000 --> 00:22:09,000
Their opponent
was an even greater monster.

139
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:12,000
[closing theme song playing]

140
00:23:28,000 --> 00:23:29,000
[upbeat music playing]

141
00:23:31,000 --> 00:23:33,000
[Gon] Next time, An Indebted Insect.

142
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:35,000
[Killua] Hey, what are you eating, Gon?

143
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:38,000
[Gon] Oh, these? They're gummi insects.

144
00:23:38,000 --> 00:23:40,000
[Killua groans]
How can you eat those right now?

145
00:23:43,000 --> 00:23:45,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
